SCOPE
-----
The whole repository: the R pipeline, the command line, the learned layer in
ml/, the app, the configuration, the tests, the documentation, the sonification
module, and any audio, MIDI or score published under the TissueSpectF name.

One licence, no exceptions. No file in this repository states different terms;
if you find one, it is a bug and this file governs.


